
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title><%= title %> | South-Pacific Engineering Ltd</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Explore civil, mechanical and refractory engineering, project management, facility management, and safety management services."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <%- include("partials/header") %>

  <main>
    <section class="page-banner">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="section-label">Our Capabilities</p>
        <h1 class="section-title">
          ENGINEERING<br>
          SOLUTIONS THAT<br>
          MOVE INDUSTRY.
        </h1>
        <p class="section-description">
          Integrated engineering and management services designed
          to enhance asset value, support safety, and improve
          operational efficiency.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section services">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="section-label">What We Do</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">OUR SERVICES.</h2>

        <p class="section-description">
          South-Pacific Engineering Ltd brings together specialist
          engineering and management disciplines to address client
          requirements across the asset lifecycle.
        </p>

        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number">01 / ENGINEERING</span>
            <h3>Civil Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Civil engineering expertise for infrastructure,
              structural works, and the built environment.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number">02 / ENGINEERING</span>
            <h3>Mechanical Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Mechanical engineering support for equipment,
              systems, and reliable industrial operations.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number">03 / ENGINEERING</span>
            <h3>Refractory Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Specialist refractory engineering for the protection
              and performance of high-temperature industrial assets.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number">04 / MANAGEMENT</span>
            <h3>Project Management</h3>
            <p>
              Project planning, coordination, monitoring, and
              oversight focused on project objectives.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number">05 / MANAGEMENT</span>
            <h3>Facility Management</h3>
            <p>
              Facility management focused on asset value,
              service performance, and operational efficiency,
              with alignment to applicable IFMA Standards.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number">06 / MANAGEMENT</span>
            <h3>Safety Management</h3>
            <p>
              Safety management practices intended to support
              hazard awareness, safer working environments,
              and responsible operations.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section intro">
      <div class="container intro-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Our Approach</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">
            BUILT AROUND<br>
            YOUR OBJECTIVES.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="section-description">
            We believe effective engineering begins with
            understanding the client's requirements and selecting
            practical, safe, and sustainable solutions.
          </p>

          <p class="section-description" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            Our integrated service approach supports coordination
            across technical disciplines, project delivery,
            facility operations, and safety management.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section contact">
      <div class="container contact-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Start a Conversation</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">
            WHAT DOES YOUR<br>
            PROJECT NEED?
          </h2>
          <p class="section-description">
            Contact our team to discuss your requirements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="/contact#quote" class="btn btn-primary">
          Request a Quote ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include("partials/footer") %>

</body>
</html>
